      "writtenOn": "2019-09-21T00:25:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should have been quoted from Line 162 (just like done in cr50), but this patch has used the reversed value by mistake.\nusb_console_tx_valid() always returned FALSE because STM32_USB_EP(USB_EP_CONSOLE) value was 0x00003021 always, where EP_TX status is EP_TX_NAK (0x20) not EP_TX_VALID(0x30).\nThe logic and function name are confusing, but I am leaving this to servod team.",
      "range": {
